### Ejecuta authLogin una vez en este archivo para obtener un token sin copiarlo.
# Selecciona admin, despacho o custom en el entorno de REST Client.
@accessToken = {{authLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name authLogin
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{authUsername}}",
  "password": "{{authPassword}}"
}

### 1. Obtener un turno para sacar su driver
# @name GetShiftLiq
GET http://localhost:4000/api/turnos/3
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
@driverLiqId = {{GetShiftLiq.response.body.$.shift.driver_id}}
@shiftLiqId = {{GetShiftLiq.response.body.$.shift.id}}

### 2. Crear nueva carrera para este turno/conductor
# @name CreateTripLiq
POST http://localhost:4000/api/carreras
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passenger_id": 3,
  "shift_id": {{shiftLiqId}},
  "fare_id": 1
}

###
@newTripLiqId = {{CreateTripLiq.response.body.$.trip.id}}

### 3. Avanzar la carrera a cerrada para poder liquidarla
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/carreras/{{newTripLiqId}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "aceptada" }

###
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/carreras/{{newTripLiqId}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "en_curso" }

###
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/carreras/{{newTripLiqId}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "cerrada" }

### 4. POST 404 Conductor inexistente
POST http://localhost:4000/api/liquidaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driver_id": 99999,
  "date_from": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "date_to": "2030-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### 5. POST 400 Conductor sin carreras en rango
POST http://localhost:4000/api/liquidaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driver_id": {{driverLiqId}},
  "date_from": "1990-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "date_to": "1991-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### 6. POST válido (Transaccional)
# @name CreateSettlement
POST http://localhost:4000/api/liquidaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driver_id": {{driverLiqId}},
  "date_from": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "date_to": "2040-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "notes": "Liquidacion desde REST client"
}

###
@liqId = {{CreateSettlement.response.body.$.settlement.id}}

### 7. Verificar que la carrera quedó con settlement_id asignado
GET http://localhost:4000/api/carreras/{{newTripLiqId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
